    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>The Tal Alrimal 2 project is a residential development located in Al Rimal District of Riyadh on a land area of 13,869 square meters (sqms) featuring ten buildings that comprise 145 smart apartments and 18 town houses with various designs ranging from 102 to 207 sqms, alongside various amenities.</p>\r\n",
